    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rather realistic tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <strong>realistic tactics</strong> and command your squad in <strong>Squad 22: ZOV</strong>, a gripping <strong>tactical strategy game</strong>. Utilizing a top-down view with an 'active pause' system, strategically plan every action. Exploit the unique <strong>personal skills</strong> and attributes of your squad members, deploy a diverse arsenal of <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong> equipment</strong>, and utilize <strong>drones</strong> and <strong>external support</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with insights from Russian veterans and active soldiers, <strong>Squad 22: ZOV</strong> delivers an authentic and intense <strong>infantry warfare</strong> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game is officially recommended by the Russian Military for use as a basic infantry tactic manual for cadet and Yunarmy training.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573040/extras/4e14b745e4400bfd53c6d132af6d1c52.avif?t=1750454497\" data-has-big width=800 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a variety of <strong>dynamic missions</strong>, from defending open areas to storming buildings and executing <strong>forest night stealth</strong> operations. <strong>Rescue hostages</strong>, capture prisoners, and leverage <strong>ally armored vehicle support</strong>, <strong>long-range snipers</strong>, and <strong>artillery strikes</strong>. Be prepared to face the same tactics from the enemy as you navigate intense combat scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter and interact with <strong>civilians</strong>, making choices that impact the unfolding events and the narrative's direction. Your decisions matter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573040/extras/69d2222625930d1fc14ece36cc1cea44.avif?t=1750454497\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression and Content: A Constantly Evolving Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through campaigns and master an ever-expanding collection of <strong>small arms</strong>, <strong>grenades</strong>, <strong>ammunition</strong>, and <strong>special items</strong>. We continuously enhance the game with updates featuring new <strong>weapon types and mods</strong>, <strong>armored vehicles</strong>, <strong>drones</strong>, <strong>equipment</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, and <strong>locations</strong>, ensuring a rich and evolving player experience. Enjoy a continuous stream of <strong>content additions</strong> as the game grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Combat Micromanagement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exercise complete control over your squad with detailed <strong>combat micromanagement</strong>. Monitor view angles, ensure squad coverage, carefully manage <strong>ammo load</strong>, and effectively utilize <strong>tactical medicine</strong>. As your squad progresses, unlock even more tactical options and strategic depth. Dive into in-depth <strong>squad management</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573040/extras/fe5b35d066bd6c2ec6fbbc85ca46b2c3.avif?t=1750454497\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History as it is</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the complexities of the 2014 and 2022-2024 events through compelling campaigns. Gain insight into the perspectives of those who lived through these periods, understanding how these events shaped their lives and opinions. Explore a narrative based on people's experience and opinions during specific historical conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573040/extras/eb27f0ae7109cefbc2e8df2a136eaa8b.avif?t=1750454497\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Beta</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in Beta mode. While we consider it to be in a good state with many game mechanics and complete narrative scenario, there are still some more things we wish to add for it to become a truly modern infantry warfare! Also, we will track player experience and may tune balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will keep deploying more content through 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rather realistic tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <strong>realistic tactics</strong> and command your squad in <strong>Squad 22: ZOV</strong>, a gripping <strong>tactical strategy game</strong>. Utilizing a top-down view with an 'active pause' system, strategically plan every action. Exploit the unique <strong>personal skills</strong> and attributes of your squad members, deploy a diverse arsenal of <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong> equipment</strong>, and utilize <strong>drones</strong> and <strong>external support</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with insights from Russian veterans and active soldiers, <strong>Squad 22: ZOV</strong> delivers an authentic and intense <strong>infantry warfare</strong> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game is officially recommended by the Russian Military for use as a basic infantry tactic manual for cadet and Yunarmy training.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573040/extras/4e14b745e4400bfd53c6d132af6d1c52.avif?t=1750454497\" data-has-big width=800 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a variety of <strong>dynamic missions</strong>, from defending open areas to storming buildings and executing <strong>forest night stealth</strong> operations. <strong>Rescue hostages</strong>, capture prisoners, and leverage <strong>ally armored vehicle support</strong>, <strong>long-range snipers</strong>, and <strong>artillery strikes</strong>. Be prepared to face the same tactics from the enemy as you navigate intense combat scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter and interact with <strong>civilians</strong>, making choices that impact the unfolding events and the narrative's direction. Your decisions matter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573040/extras/69d2222625930d1fc14ece36cc1cea44.avif?t=1750454497\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression and Content: A Constantly Evolving Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through campaigns and master an ever-expanding collection of <strong>small arms</strong>, <strong>grenades</strong>, <strong>ammunition</strong>, and <strong>special items</strong>. We continuously enhance the game with updates featuring new <strong>weapon types and mods</strong>, <strong>armored vehicles</strong>, <strong>drones</strong>, <strong>equipment</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, and <strong>locations</strong>, ensuring a rich and evolving player experience. Enjoy a continuous stream of <strong>content additions</strong> as the game grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Combat Micromanagement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exercise complete control over your squad with detailed <strong>combat micromanagement</strong>. Monitor view angles, ensure squad coverage, carefully manage <strong>ammo load</strong>, and effectively utilize <strong>tactical medicine</strong>. As your squad progresses, unlock even more tactical options and strategic depth. Dive into in-depth <strong>squad management</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573040/extras/fe5b35d066bd6c2ec6fbbc85ca46b2c3.avif?t=1750454497\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History as it is</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the complexities of the 2014 and 2022-2024 events through compelling campaigns. Gain insight into the perspectives of those who lived through these periods, understanding how these events shaped their lives and opinions. Explore a narrative based on people's experience and opinions during specific historical conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573040/extras/eb27f0ae7109cefbc2e8df2a136eaa8b.avif?t=1750454497\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Beta</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in Beta mode. While we consider it to be in a good state with many game mechanics and complete narrative scenario, there are still some more things we wish to add for it to become a truly modern infantry warfare! Also, we will track player experience and may tune balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will keep deploying more content through 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
